scene cutout.esn
alike
window 320 240

# The torus through a checker mask, half its texels clear. The package's
# cutout and the fast path pick the same triangle at every pixel on the
# interpreter and the JIT; on a GPU the device's rasterizer takes an edge
# pixel or a texel's border the other way now and then, fifteen of some
# twenty thousand here.
frame 0.0
expect differ.result[0] <= 64
# And the mask takes the same pixels from the torus on every backend.
expect taken.result[0] = 6728
# The package's tiled forms, cut two pixels to a tile, draw what its
# one-pass forms draw, every word to the bit, with a mask and without.
expect split.result[0] = 0
